        "text": "クヴァレルガに沈められた者たちの怨霊……。\nまさか比喩でもなんでもなく、怨霊そのものとは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The vengeful spirits of those dragged down by Kvarelga... To think they weren't just metaphors, but actual spirits..."
